# .git is intentionally NOT excluded: dev_install.py resolves the installable
# package set via `git ls-files`, so the build stage needs a real git index.
#
# Everything outside openbb_platform/, cli/, and .git is irrelevant to this
# image and gets excluded explicitly (desktop/ alone is a ~29GB node_modules
# tree) rather than relying on an allowlist, since the top-level layout is
# effectively a monorepo of unrelated projects.
desktop
images
examples
wargame
cookiecutter
build
docs
.venv
**/.venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
**/.mypy_cache
.coverage
**/.coverage
htmlcov
**/htmlcov
dist
**/dist
*.egg-info
**/*.egg-info
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
node_modules
**/node_modules
.idea
.vscode
*.md
!openbb_platform/**/README.md
